---
---
<section class="section-scope-clarity" id="scope-clarity">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="scope-alternating-layout">
      <!-- Left: Image -->
      <div class="scope-image-wrapper">
        <img 
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522071820081-009f0129c71c?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80" 
          alt="Professional workspace planning" 
          class="scope-image"
        />
        <!-- Decorative Shape behind image -->
        <div class="scope-image-decor"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Text & List -->
      <div class="scope-content">
        <span class="weroast-badge-pill" style="margin-bottom: 1rem; border-color: rgba(105, 83, 138, 0.2);">
          Înainte de implementare
        </span>
        <h2 class="scope-title">
          Stabilim clar proiectul <span class="text-brand-purple">înainte</span> de a începe.
        </h2>
        <p class="scope-desc">
          Astfel, domeniul de aplicare al proiectului este clar definit înainte de a începe designul și dezvoltarea.
        </p>

        <ul class="scope-list">
          <li>
            <svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
            </svg>
            obiectivul și prioritățile noii prezențe;
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
            </svg>
            serviciile incluse și cele neincluse;
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
            </svg>
            conținuturile, imaginile, datele și accesurile existente;
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
            </svg>
            materialele, responsabilitățile și aprobările necesare;
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
            </svg>
            cadrul de timp și investiție;
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
            </svg>
            ce include prima lansare și ce poate urma ulterior;
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
            </svg>
            predarea accesurilor, datelor și drepturilor de utilizare.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section-scope-clarity {
    padding: 8rem 0;
    background: #ffffff;
  }
  
  .scope-alternating-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  
  /* Image Side */
  .scope-image-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    z-index: 2;
  }
  
  .scope-image {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }
  
  .scope-image-decor {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -2rem;
    left: -2rem;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: var(--brand-purple-soft);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* Content Side */
  .scope-content {
    max-width: 550px;
  }

  .scope-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 3.5vw, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--brand-navy);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  
  .text-brand-purple {
    color: var(--brand-purple);
  }
  
  .scope-desc {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .scope-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }
  
  .scope-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  
  .check-icon {
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    color: var(--brand-purple);
    background: var(--brand-purple-soft);
    border-radius: 50%;
    padding: 3px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .scope-alternating-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 4rem;
    }
    
    .scope-image-wrapper {
      order: 2; /* Image on bottom for mobile */
      margin-left: 2rem; /* space for decor */
    }
    
    .scope-content {
      order: 1; /* Text on top for mobile */
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>

